    "implementation_delta": "Publish DatasetsSemanticContextPack@1 as the Datasets-owned builder of DatasetsContextPack@1 for the PCPR-060 reference idea. Hermetic AST inspection of LogicProviderProtocol@2 selects impacted tests, declares ProofObligation@1 records without live verification, reuses unaffected solver-qualification proofs, and rejects stale-tree evidence. AccelerateSemanticContextPackBinding@1 consumes SupervisorContextPack as a binding of the owner pack CID bafkreih72d3nncekez43wmtlczq5mdtymzniluujypwybpgu3mtt7i4v2e and refuses remint. KitSemanticContextPackBinding@1 binds the same CID and does not store bytes or publish a current root. Live supervisor admission, live solver-backed impact, live DuckDB or Quack materialization, and START stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-061-operator-live-context-pack-admission. Durable storage remains PCPR-062. Deterministic execution remains PCPR-063. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
